---
source: system/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"setpgid\")"
---
Run a program in a new process group

Usage: setpgid [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>...

Arguments:
  <COMMAND>...  Program and its arguments

Options:
  -f, --foreground  Make the new process group the foreground process group
  -h, --help        Print help
  -V, --version     Print version
